StructuralRule.Notes:
Matches Express routes that don't use csrf protection middleware.
For example: app.get("/secret-stuff", myRoute);
csrf protect example:
app.get("/secret-stuff", doubleCsrfProtection, myProtectedRoute);
But csrf protection middleware can be omitted if it's set globally.
For example: app.use(doubleCsrfProtection) or app.use(csrfSynchronisedProtection);
rulescript `expressjs_csrf_check.js` will clean this vulnerabilities if global protection is found.

