CharacterizationRule.Notes:
Can set innerHTML in React in the following way:

component.props.dangerouslySetInnerHTML = {__html: dangerousInput };

In this case we're going to flag on the scenario that somebody can control the entire object being passed to dangerouslySetInnerHTML

