Set cookie domains to be as restrictive as possible.

<b>Example 2:</b> The following code shows how to set the cookie domain to "<code>secure.example.com</code>", which fixes <code>Example 1</code>.
<pre>
  cookie_options = {};
  cookie_options.domain = 'secure.example.com';
  ...
  res.cookie('important_cookie', info, cookie_options);
</pre>

Set cookie domains to be as restrictive as possible.

<b>Example 2:</b> The following code shows how to set the cookie domain to "<code>secure.example.com</code>" for the example in <code>Example 1</code>.
<pre>
