  cookie_options.domain = 'secure.example.com';
  ...
  res.cookie('important_cookie', info, cookie_options);
</pre>

<b>Example 3:</b> For AngularJS applications, this can be set across entire modules by configuring the ngCookies provider.
<pre>
myModule.config(['$cookiesProvider', function($cookiesProvider){
