  ...
  $cookiesProvider.defaults = myDefaults;
}]);
</pre>

Make sure to set cookie paths to be as restrictive as possible.

<b>Example 2:</b> The following code shows how to set the cookie path to "<code>/MyForum</code>", which fixes <code>Example 1</code>.
<pre>
  cookie_options = {};
  cookie_options.path = '/MyForum';
  ...
  res.cookie('important_cookie', info, cookie_options);
</pre>

